-    *   Weighting factor $\lambda_r$ for the similarity score.
-*   **Outputs:**
-    *   Group assignments for each Gaussian.
-    *   Shared SE(3) parameters $\{h_j^0, R_j^t, T_j^t\}$ for each group $j \in [0, J-1]$.
+**Inputs:**
